---
const { standalone = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="wrap mission" id="mission">
  {standalone ? (
    <h1 class="about-title">Mission</h1>
  ) : (
    <p class="cap">Mission</p>
  )}
  <p class="say">
    We integrate large biomedical data in genomics, structural biology,
    pharmacology and health care with new computational methods,{" "}
    <span>
      to find novel drug targets and reveal the principles that run biological
      systems.
    </span>
  </p>
</section>
